{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c43051887b5f94d11aad07c7eb563473864973bd6dc2f5b30e34f70bcdfd8576", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのアイドルを探すために、\n女性向けのファッションイベントに来たんだが……）", "zh": "（为了替39PROJECT找寻偶像人选，\n我跑来参加以女性客群为主的时尚活动……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1001_shikai", "source_sha256": "dc007433c97da4dc080330e83268c9088163aa0726615ab6f2ba49f631aee455", "ja": "それでは、本日モデルとして参加してくれたみんなに、\n一言ずついただきます！　まずは、翼ちゃんから！", "zh": "接下来请本日参加活动的模特儿们\n发表简短感言！首先有请小翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1dffff2d94c6e07ff197649d146e3f7b4bb79a6aac8d43281ebfa0dab40041cf", "ja": "は～い！\nわたし、伊吹翼で～す！　みんな、ありがとー♪", "zh": "好～！\n我是伊吹翼～！谢谢大家──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8a483a351ac9dd041b3c101f5d12a2bfbbeee52f74a1ca8fedf643bd09dd2273", "ja": "（いま挨拶してるあの子、ステージでも目立ってたな。\n可愛いだけじゃなくて、目を引くというか……）", "zh": "（刚才打招呼的孩子在表演时也很突出呢。\n不只人可爱，一举一动都很吸睛……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d2cf805525ea920ad666d0ea65d298b0537e17f8a132ac6b8cce5a955ae065a5", "ja": "今日は、カワイイお洋服がいっぱい着られて、\n最高でした！　すっごく楽しかったで～す♪", "zh": "今天能穿这么多可爱的洋装，\n真是太棒了！我很开心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2d6e0c542286e62bb92e81b89edaba38161dabda3b2d6681dc8a8319264793d1", "ja": "買い物中に、店員さんにモデルをお願いされた時は、\nちょっとビックリしちゃったけど。えへへ♪", "zh": "虽然是在买东西时被店员邀来当模特儿，\n让我有点惊讶，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "bc2c721d81b4dfb8039b3ee79900ddfb7d0c20bc9a13df0b4abdd40b0354c268", "ja": "（あの子、プロのモデルじゃなかったのか。\nでも、どの子よりも輝いて見えた……）", "zh": "（原来她不是职业模特儿。\n不过她看起来比其他人都还耀眼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4c0b936804f4fe4f5866651097eeee8485ce50d0942663129d7dcab4f7405318", "ja": "（お客さんの声援も大きかったし……\nよし、イベントが終わったら声をかけてみよう！）", "zh": "（观众的呼声也很大……\n好，等活动结束后去问问她吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "136748d00bf3595990e3e635b336e00d0da329e835a76abb27c222d8293553cb", "ja": "お疲れ様でした～！\nふぅ、ちょっと疲れちゃったかも。はやく帰ろ～っと。", "zh": "大家辛苦了～！\n呼，感觉有点累了。赶快回家吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a43b288a236186616fd206ce9a0925528da32b7265fbf1bd989d36ee17e682db", "ja": "さっきのイベントでモデルをやっていた\n伊吹翼さん……だよね？　時間いいかな？", "zh": "你是刚才活动时当模特儿的伊吹翼小姐……\n对吧？你有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1b82ed3fa5a6c092a8d25e9a1828b84c0c9f93acc67ff5a7fff3a960499a5d69", "ja": "え、わたしですか？\nちょっとだけなら、いいですけど……。", "zh": "咦，找我吗？\n如果只要一下下的话是可以啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f2d85a238787a936a582e067dbdb9aa80a2e607badebf38d00a82bc9621d4851", "ja": "あ～～！？\nこれって、もしかしてナンパですか！？", "zh": "啊～～！？\n这该不会是搭讪吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3d3c2dc13b06b6a5b7d4af74cb33dad609c3cf34843f81675f1d6aae793ce209", "ja": "いや、ナンパじゃなくて……。", "zh": "不，不是搭讪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ec215dec637337db02f0ebb154efbf864bd6c5a16bd8486417426dd206d543f0", "ja": "モデルって、やっぱりモテるんだ～。\nわたし、モテ期が来ちゃったのかも♪", "zh": "模特儿果然很受欢迎啊～\n我的桃花期说不定要来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0fc16846a339ab8281d31f0930272adcde5171479599ab261042b8cddf598fab", "ja": "そうじゃなくて。\nええと、こういう者なんだけど……。", "zh": "不是那样的。\n呃，我是做这一行的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_1015", "source_sha256": "af64cb5745e12f46015965a25065eec951dbf0fe41fc1cee6cc18e96b64fe4f6", "ja": "名刺を取り出す", "zh": "拿出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "48fa71056fa13e57776696c2a7efd8169251949ab508e23102a417e1cd76af02", "ja": "俺は、アイドルのプロデューサーをしているんだ。\n君、アイドルに興味ないかな？", "zh": "我是偶像制作人，\n你对当偶像有兴趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d1ef4b71a06de214e862c62cdb9cf897fc94b09a42a40a91cbc135830cc14c51", "ja": "え～っ？\nアイドルって、わたしがですか？", "zh": "咦～？\n当偶像？我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3356942f50e14a07799b16ecbf5339764efe759c2a4e5482c0500aeea4c65359", "ja": "うーん、面白そうだけど……\nでも、アイドルってなんか大変そう～。", "zh": "嗯～虽然应该会很有趣……\n不过当偶像感觉好辛苦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "43f1658998c1d693b2ec17985700564f96cf949938dd4dfc1276088c1a5cbcd9", "ja": "歌とかダンスとか、すっごくレッスンしなくちゃ\nダメなんでしょ？　わたし、キツいのは嫌だな～。", "zh": "像是唱歌跳舞之类的，得做很多训练对吧？\n我讨厌辛苦的事～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "ac63c7bdd951d233d4d3a9c366fca280c0afd6ab2b2b3e4c53c28a8207aa685b", "ja": "そうか……\nでもステージの上では、すごく楽しそうに見えたけど？", "zh": "这样啊……\n不过我看你刚才在舞台上似乎很开心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0c32795f6df6676b80fd1c6af7373655b0519c15ff835a4ac011afa2bb862408", "ja": "うん、すっごく楽しかった♪　でも今日はショップの\n店員さんに頼まれただけで、レッスンとかしてないし。", "zh": "嗯，很开心♪但我今天只是被商店的店员\n拜托才来的，并没有做什么训练啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2006_p", "source_sha256": "04dac084f18da9ed1c71fefbbcfaeb15d4775e227e239d44630be5350fa44210", "ja": "確かに、アイドルには大変なこともあるかな……。", "zh": "当偶像有时的确很辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f5b1ab4f8e6941349fbc77f815fb13b63d41b27a865d88117dec232100221a19", "ja": "やっぱり～。", "zh": "果然是这样～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "60839afbde7992b32cd57bf663470443d55dacb90a0e19a825fc4d5620e1da28", "ja": "けどそれ以上に、アイドルになった者にしか\n経験できないことが、たくさんあるんだ！", "zh": "但除此之外，还有很多事\n是只有当上偶像的人才能体验到的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bc28f5881f71d48f91eb9aa1062d8c5e0c7253a42541f8ed7cf7dd851661f069", "ja": "アイドルになった者にしか、経験できないこと？\nう～ん……。", "zh": "只有当上偶像的人才能体验到？\n唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "555613986c897ebb84caa5b5f9efca45a88da77b4bae615a58e27df145e962b5", "ja": "ああ、そうだ。それに今日みたいな\n可愛い衣装だって、たくさん着られるよ。", "zh": "嗯，对啊。而且也可以像今天一样，\n穿很多可爱的服装喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c6225156e787e7c6b4882c7fcff6d4eaebfd42dad081398a03137fadfb3e48e5", "ja": "ホントですか？　今日みたいに、\nすっごくオシャレでカワイイ服ですよ？", "zh": "真的吗？你是说像今天这种\n又时髦又可爱的服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a85369a38d5150b72e8f6da53d2f158b05997665ec6247b441cf220f5541d1e6", "ja": "あと、ちょっと大人っぽいメイクでしょ。\nそれから、自分じゃできないヘアセットとか……。", "zh": "还会化有点成熟的妆，\n帮我打理我自己做不出来的发型之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2013_p", "source_sha256": "b89369c3340160e30a51bcd29e9f22b993445bbcc02c283bf30c44cac840aa01", "ja": "できるできる！　それにアイドルになれば、\n君が誰よりも輝けるように、全力でサポートするよ。", "zh": "可以可以！要是你当了偶像，我会全力支援你，\n让你比任何人都还要发光发热。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e4938d399d714999c5d096a78c5d509dc7b1a444cd4c45ffea5133172a18c59a", "ja": "わたしが輝けるように……？\nそれって、モテモテになっちゃうってコトですか？", "zh": "让我发光发热……？\n你是说让我变成超受欢迎的万人迷吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2015_p", "source_sha256": "6798a8d370320cae7f59328063aa3f0895a183f1a163a5de490d1fb39852e9b4", "ja": "モテモテ……まぁ、そういうことかな。\nどう、アイドルになってみないか？", "zh": "万人迷……嗯，大概就是那种感觉吧。\n怎么样，你要不要来当偶像啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "beeb7579bc08c98a545714eced5f5a86560ba2cfa410cf732a0ef818a2e5c84a", "ja": "う～ん。そんなに言うなら、\nわたし、アイドルになっちゃおうかな～？", "zh": "唔～既然你都说到这个地步了，\n我就当当偶像吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2017_p", "source_sha256": "84b03e285ebd065750d913a2b21a12ee5e0a2d3c749b029611ab9339be98c5d2", "ja": "やった……！", "zh": "太好了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_001_2018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b4fb434a33903c5d5b7119ce3ed653114d2c73b1bedc3669655c7df6ffe04e58", "ja": "ねえねえ、えっと～……プロデューサーさん？", "zh": "话说，那个……制作人先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
